    "text": "Let $k\\geq 3$ and $f_{k,3}(x)$ denote the number of integers $\\leq x$ which are the sum of three nonnegative $k$th powers. Is it true that $ f_{k,3}(x) \\gg x^{3/k} $ or even $\\gg_\\epsilon x^{3/k-\\epsilon}$?",
